{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-BYTE-ORDER function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":938,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309567","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BYTE-ORDER-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BYTE-ORDER-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-BYTE-ORDER function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns an INTEGER value indicating the byte\norder setting of a MEMPTR variable. This will be either the value\nprovided by the last execution of SET-BYTE-ORDER with this MEMPTR\nvariable, or HOST-BYTE-ORDER if SET-BYTE-ORDER has not been executed. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function__syntax_GC18MQ2693473\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d48725e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function__idGDL2HO2671075\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-BYTE-ORDER( <var class=\"keyword varname\">memptr</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">memptr</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that returns a MEMPTR.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function__note_GC18MR2693479\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d48725e140\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">GET-BYTE-ORDER\nnever affects data currently in the MEMPTR. That is, it does not\nactually re-order the data. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BYTE-ORDER-function__see-also_GC18MS2693483\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d48725e149\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html#SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BYTE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTE-function.html\">GET-BYTE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BYTES-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTES-function.html\">GET-BYTES function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309567","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":938,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-BYTE-ORDER function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTE-ORDER-function.html","type":"Manual"}